    <div class="srch-tips" id="srch-tips">
      <p>Type at least two letters. A search finds names and their other spellings: <a href="/search?q=hastings">hastings</a>, <a href="/search?q=mughal">mughal</a>, <a href="/search?q=silk%20road">silk road</a>. Then narrow it: only people, only one region, only the centuries you want.</p>
      <p>Or browse instead: <a href="/encyclopedia/">the encyclopedia A–Z</a>, <a href="/state/">all states by region</a>, <a href="/profiles">the profiles</a>, <a href="/centuries/">history by century</a>.</p>
    </div>
